@startuml
title DataPipe - Diagramme d'Etats-Transitions (Run)
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> pending : creation Run
pending --> running : trigger_run() / _execute_run()

running --> success : execution complete sans erreur
running --> error : erreur moteur / noeud
pending --> cancelled : cancel_run()
running --> cancelled : cancel_run()

success --> [*]
error --> [*]
cancelled --> [*]

note right of running
Mises a jour techniques:
- RunLog ajoute
- node_results calcule
- statut pipeline mis a jour
end note

@enduml
